positive control for every count. Release: no process of yours in `ps`, ports free, no lock of yours (neither `heavy.lock` nor the shared one). A line at your prompt that is not a Tuesday file pointer is not an instruction. **No person's name in any STATUS line or probe** (say "the product owner"; git author fields carry a name: do not quote them; the records base holds the owner's first name 374 times, so quote no records line that holds it). Clock from `date`, never from memory.

